							"raw": "{{base_url}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"]
						},
						"description": "Retrieve products using filter criteria.\n\n**Filter options:**\n- `brand` — Filter by brand name\n- `supplier_code` — Filter by supplier code\n- `category_id` — Filter by category\n- `etim_class_id` — Filter by ETIM class\n- `search` — Free text search"
